# 16.8 s a clip): 16.8 s x 64/48 x 1.02 = 22.8 s a clip, x 24 = 548 s; + load 43 s + imports and CUDA init ~10 s = ~600 s =
# 10 min. A cold page cache would add the 38 GB read, +1..2 min. Peak card memory ~23 GB of the A6000's 48 GB.
kind: exclusive
reason: generation fills the A6000 (weights ~19 GB, peak ~23 GB) and reads ~38 GB of weights through the page
  cache, so it holds the lease instead of running beside a timed run or a gate batch; why now: the user asked for
  Mwoyeo film 2's music to be generated on the box (2026-10-20), and film 2's build is cut to its beat grid
